## Environment Bootstrap & Migration Protocol

Repository + docs-ai = knowledge truth. **Never assume previous machine state.**

Details: [MIGRATION.md](../../docs-ai/cross-cutting/bootstrap/MIGRATION.md) · [ENVIRONMENT-CHECKLIST.md](../../docs-ai/cross-cutting/bootstrap/ENVIRONMENT-CHECKLIST.md)

